Tool-Calling Agents using LangChain and Gemini — Healthcare
1. Objective

The objective of this assignment is to develop an AI-powered Healthcare Patient Triage Assistant using LangChain, Google Gemini, tool calling, custom Python tools, agentic decision-making, system prompts, and guardrails.

The assistant accepts a patient's symptoms and basic information in natural language, identifies relevant symptom categories, uses a custom healthcare assessment tool to calculate an initial synthetic severity score, identifies risk indicators, and provides an appropriate recommendation.

The system is intended only for initial triage demonstration purposes and does not provide a medical diagnosis.

